\name{cellucid_layout_panel_dock_all}
\alias{cellucid_layout_panel_dock_all}
\title{Dock every section}
\usage{
cellucid_layout_panel_dock_all(viewer)
}
\arguments{
\item{viewer}{A viewer \code{\link{cellucid_view}()} or \code{\link{cellucid_serve}()} returned.}
}
\value{
A \code{cellucid_action_request}, at once and invisibly: the action is sent now, or when the viewer's channel opens.
\code{\link{cellucid_action_result}(request)} returns its outcome (what it did, as names, counts and ids), or \code{NULL} when it had nothing to report; \code{request$step} is the history step it made.
}
\description{
Put every floating sidebar section back into the sidebar, each where it was (the sidebar's Dock all button).
}
\details{
The viewer's action \code{layout.panel.dock-all} (Layout). It changes the viewer's layout: one step of the viewer's history, labeled as R's, undone like any other. The state it can change: \code{layout}.
}
\seealso{
\code{\link{cellucid_act}()} sends any action by its type, and \code{\link{cellucid_action_result}()}
collects its answer.
}
